    "righting_reflex_held": "When the teacher said \"I was not sure if that was useful,\" you replied \"It was.\"",
    "rehearsed_the_step": "You said \"So your commitment is to use 'think, pair, share' at least twice...\" but did not ask the teacher to rehearse it out loud."
  },
  "did": {
    "opened_with_specific_praise": "You opened with \"Two things really worked.\"",
